### Game Service - Complete API Reference
### Base URL: http://localhost:9001 (direct) or http://localhost:8888/game-service (via gateway)

### ============================================
### HEALTH CHECK
### ============================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:9001/api/health

### ============================================
### GAMES
### ============================================

### Get all games
GET http://localhost:9001/api/games

### Get games by type
GET http://localhost:9001/api/games?type=QUIZ

### Get games by difficulty
GET http://localhost:9001/api/games?difficulty=EASY

### Get specific game
GET http://localhost:9001/api/games/1

### Get game content for playing
GET http://localhost:9001/api/games/1/play?limit=5

### Submit game answers
POST http://localhost:9001/api/games/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "1": "A",
    "2": "B",
    "3": "C",
    "4": "A",
    "5": "D"
  },
  "timeSpent": 45
}

### ============================================
### PLAYER SESSION
### ============================================

### Get current player session
GET http://localhost:9001/api/session

### Get session for specific user (admin)
GET http://localhost:9001/api/session/default-user

### Reset lives
POST http://localhost:9001/api/session/reset-lives

### Full session reset (admin)
POST http://localhost:9001/api/session/default-user/reset

### ============================================
### ACHIEVEMENTS
### ============================================

### Get all achievements with progress
GET http://localhost:9001/api/achievements

### Get earned achievements only
GET http://localhost:9001/api/achievements/earned

### Check for new achievements
POST http://localhost:9001/api/achievements/check

### Mark achievements as notified
POST http://localhost:9001/api/achievements/mark-notified

### ============================================
### LEADERBOARD
### ============================================

### Top players by XP
GET http://localhost:9001/api/leaderboard/xp?limit=10

### Top players by level
GET http://localhost:9001/api/leaderboard/level?limit=10

### Top players by wins
GET http://localhost:9001/api/leaderboard/wins?limit=10

### Top players by streak
GET http://localhost:9001/api/leaderboard/streak?limit=10

### Get my rank
GET http://localhost:9001/api/leaderboard/my-rank

### ============================================
### STATISTICS
### ============================================

### Get platform statistics
GET http://localhost:9001/api/statistics/platform

### ============================================
### ADMIN - GAME MANAGEMENT
### ============================================

### Create new game
POST http://localhost:9001/api/admin/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Vocabulary Quiz",
  "type": "QUIZ",
  "difficulty": "HARD",
  "description": "Test your advanced English vocabulary"
}

### Update game
PUT http://localhost:9001/api/admin/games/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Game Title",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "isActive": true
}

### Delete game
DELETE http://localhost:9001/api/admin/games/1

### Add game content
POST http://localhost:9001/api/admin/games/1/content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionText": "What is the capital of France?",
  "correctAnswer": "Paris",
  "options": ["London", "Paris", "Berlin", "Madrid"],
  "explanation": "Paris is the capital and largest city of France"
}

### Bulk add game content
POST http://localhost:9001/api/admin/games/1/content/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "questionText": "What is 2 + 2?",
    "correctAnswer": "4",
    "options": ["2", "3", "4", "5"]
  },
  {
    "questionText": "What color is the sky?",
    "correctAnswer": "Blue",
    "options": ["Red", "Blue", "Green", "Yellow"]
  }
]

### ============================================
### VIA API GATEWAY
### ============================================

### Get games via gateway
GET http://localhost:8888/game-service/api/games

### Submit game via gateway
POST http://localhost:8888/game-service/api/games/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "1": "A",
    "2": "B"
  },
  "timeSpent": 30
}

### Get leaderboard via gateway
GET http://localhost:8888/game-service/api/leaderboard/xp?limit=10

### Get achievements via gateway
GET http://localhost:8888/game-service/api/achievements

### Get statistics via gateway
GET http://localhost:8888/game-service/api/statistics/platform

### ============================================
### PROGRESSIVE QUIZ
### ============================================

### Start quiz session
POST http://localhost:9001/api/quiz/start/1

### Get next question
GET http://localhost:9001/api/quiz/next

### Submit answer
POST http://localhost:9001/api/quiz/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": 1,
  "answer": "Paris"
}

### Get quiz results
GET http://localhost:9001/api/quiz/results

### ============================================
### USER PROGRESS
### ============================================

### Get user progress for a game
GET http://localhost:9001/api/progress/game/1

### Get user statistics
GET http://localhost:9001/api/progress/stats

### ============================================
### GAME LEVELS
### ============================================

### Get levels for a game
GET http://localhost:9001/api/games/1/levels

### Get next level to play
GET http://localhost:9001/api/games/1/levels/next

### Complete a level
POST http://localhost:9001/api/games/1/levels/1/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 85,
  "stars": 3
}

